{"seq":3,"slug":"consumer-side","title":"Consumer 侧工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/consumer-side","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"idempotent-receiver","title":"幂等接收器设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/consumer-side/idempotent-receiver","wordCount":1363,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"async-processing-queue","title":"异步处理与队列集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/consumer-side/async-processing-queue","wordCount":1530,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"webhook-testing-simulation","title":"Webhook 测试与模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/consumer-side/webhook-testing-simulation","wordCount":1227,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# Consumer 侧工程\n\n作为 webhook 的接收方，你面对的是来自外部系统的不可控流量：可能乱序、可能重复、可能在你的服务最脆弱时蜂拥而至。本章聚焦三个关键能力——幂等接收确保重复投递不产生副作用、异步队列将外部流量与核心业务解耦、测试与模拟为集成提供确定性的验证手段。\n\n三篇文档帮助你构建一个「接得住、扛得住、测得准」的 webhook 消费端架构。\n"}